# Basis branch: a named u basis, then an inline v matrix of 17 values. gman
# is expected to stop with RIE_CONSISTENCY.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Basis "bezier" 3 [ 6.125 6.25 6.375 6.5 6.625 6.75 6.875 7 7.125 7.25 7.375 7.5 7.625 7.75 7.875 8 8.125 ] 3
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
